    </prov:Association>
  </prov:qualifiedAssociation>
  <vaem:rationale>The ontology models all supplied classes and individuals exactly as named, with closed class hierarchy. Object properties connect domains to ranges per the Themis tests, reversing proposed axioms where tests dictate (compose, usedIn, definedFor, inUseIn). Datatype properties carry appropriate XSD ranges (string, float, dateTime, integer) and domains matching each competency question. Axioms materialize domain/range constraints and subclass relationships required by the tests.</vaem:rationale>
</prov:Activity>

